# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_postBirthScene.rpy:23
translate ja nijah_post_birth_scene_b55b6da8:

    # "For the next hour or so, I spent some time with Nijah and our new-born child, playing and watching them with a new-found pride."
    "それから一時間ほど、私はニジャと生まれたばかりの我が子と過ごし、戯れ、新しく湧き上がる誇りを胸に彼らを見守っていた。"

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_postBirthScene.rpy:24
translate ja nijah_post_birth_scene_506f49d3:

    # "Whether it was by the {i}Dark passengers{/i} design within me, or my own natural paternal instincts stiring, I felt rejuvenated and stronger as I watched my child playfully reach out to grab my hand."
    "私の中に潜む{i}闇の乗客{/i}の仕業か、自然と湧き上がる父性の本能か、我が子が戯れに私の手を掴もうとするのを見て、私は若返り、力が漲るのを感じた。"

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_postBirthScene.rpy:25
translate ja nijah_post_birth_scene_e00fed67:

    # "A short while later, I left Nijah alone once again, onwards towards whatever was next."
    "しばらくして、私はまたニジャを一人にし、次へと進んでいく。"

